  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Bluster sphere, caster level 1st.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you create a magic sphere effect as a standard action, you may spend 3 additional spell points as a swift action to target a single creature affected by the effect with a quip. If you possess the Prolific Bluster talent, you may target as many affected creatures as you could normally target with the quip, although you must be able to outwit every target to apply a quip which requires outwitting a target.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess the Verbal Casting drawback, you may select this feat as a drawback feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
